<Layout title="Memory Card Photo Calculator: RAW, JPEG & Both" description="Calculate how many RAW or JPEG photos fit on a 32 GB, 64 GB, 128 GB, 256 GB, 512 GB or 1 TB memory card. Adjust your file sizes.">
<section class="hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">FREE PHOTOGRAPHY TOOL</p><h1>Memory card photo calculator</h1><p>Enter your camera’s RAW size or use one of our measured samples. Compare RAW, JPEG and RAW + JPEG capacity without uploads or signups.</p></section><Calculator/><section class="wrap prose compact"><h2>How many photos fit on a memory card?</h2><p>The answer depends on each photograph's file size and the card’s usable capacity. These examples use the measured Canon EOS R6 Mark II RAW sample ({(samples[0].rawBytes/1e6).toFixed(2)} MB) and an illustrative 8 MB JPEG, not a measured standalone JPEG.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Estimated photographs, nominal decimal capacity, before formatting overhead</caption><thead><tr><th>Capacity</th><th>RAW (measured sample)</th><th>JPEG (8 MB estimate)</th><th>RAW + JPEG</th></tr></thead><tbody>{[32,64,128,256,512,1024].map(size=><tr><th scope="row">{size===1024?'1 TB':size+' GB'}</th><td>{Math.floor(size*1e9/samples[0].rawBytes).toLocaleString('en-US')}</td><td>{Math.floor(size*1000/8).toLocaleString('en-US')}</td><td>{Math.floor(size*1000/(samples[0].rawBytes/1e6+8)).toLocaleString('en-US')}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p>Use your own typical file sizes for a better estimate. Files vary with compression settings and subject detail. See our <a href="/cameras/">camera sample table</a>, <a href="/methodology/">calculation method</a>, or the <a href="/">RAW vs JPEG comparison</a>.</p></section></Layout>